{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-102","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：截差无理线段与中项无理线段与平方","englishTitle":"The square on the straight line which produces with a medial area a medial whole, if applied to a rational straight line, produces as breadth a sixth apotome.","book":10,"number":102,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.102","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.102/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":102,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-102@raw-488398fed483602e","contentId":"euclid-10-102","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"488398fed483602e2d45433c435d1eb36b95ee859939a673ee44e0c0e2c4f632","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-102.statement","euclid-10-102.construction.1","euclid-10-102.construction.2","euclid-10-102.proof.1","euclid-10-102.proof.2","euclid-10-102.proof.3","euclid-10-102.proof.4","euclid-10-102.proof.5","euclid-10-102.proof.6","euclid-10-102.proof.7","euclid-10-102.proof.8","euclid-10-102.proof.9","euclid-10-102.proof.10","euclid-10-102.proof.11","euclid-10-102.proof.12","euclid-10-102.proof.13","euclid-10-102.proof.14","euclid-10-102.proof.15","euclid-10-102.proof.16","euclid-10-102.conclusion","euclid-10-102.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-102.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-102","revisionId":"euclid-10-102@raw-488398fed483602e","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"972a0268a29c3977115350e9757238acaa7244f1aaebdd6046e3f566968ce759","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The square on the straight line which produces with a medial area a medial whole, if applied to a rational straight line, produces as breadth a sixth apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"正方形直线上中项无理线段区域中项无理线段整数,如果用于有理线段,则以宽度6 截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-102.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-102","revisionId":"euclid-10-102@raw-488398fed483602e","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0c1e55c09735b36c9dc066641e96dbddbeaba3ce92a5cdff9cdf80f97bc47a4a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be the straight line which produces with a medial area a medial whole, and CD a rational straight line, and to CD let CE be applied equal to the square on AB and producing CF as breadth; I say that CF is a sixth apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"设 AB 是一条与中项面积结合后得到中项总量的线段，CD 是一条有理线段；在 CD 上作面积等于 AB 平方的矩形 CE，并使其宽为 CF。要证明：CF 是第六种截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-102.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-102","revisionId":"euclid-10-102@raw-488398fed483602e","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"763ab948469d2b7efd13b8f57b865f8e0fa10898aefd3cd8794e0cc9c17af3e0","citations":["euclid-10-78"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let BG be the annex to AB; therefore AG, GB are straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them medial, twice the rectangle AG, GB medial, and the squares on AG, GB incommensurable with twice the rectangle AG, GB. [[X. 78](/principles/euclid-10-78)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"设 BG 是附加在线段 AB 上的线段，于是 AG、GB 是两条平方不可公度的线段；它们的平方和为中项无理量，以 AG、GB 为边的矩形面积的两倍也是中项无理量，并且 AG、GB 的平方和与该矩形面积的两倍不可公度。 [[X. 78](/principles/euclid-10-78)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-102.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-102","revisionId":"euclid-10-102@raw-488398fed483602e","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b088f2ba59455b2f9394d5bb544a51ea0d1ba8a02127b4dd4f5ea0ffc0d77622","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now to CD let there be applied CH equal to the square on AG and producing CK as breadth, and KL equal to the square on BG; therefore the whole CL is equal to the squares on AG, GB; therefore CL is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在到CD, CH等于AG,CK宽度等于正方形,KL等于正方形;BG宽度等于CL;因此,整个CL等于AG,GB;因此,CL也等于中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-102.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-102","revisionId":"euclid-10-102@raw-488398fed483602e","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1dbe2585cb12021da756cd4fab93bfa8325b874e66a99b95c3224f1f6d5993c6","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line CD, producing CM as breadth; therefore CM is rational and incommensurable in length with CD. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其范围扩大到CM宽,因此,CM长为有理,不可公度长为CD。 [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-102.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-102","revisionId":"euclid-10-102@raw-488398fed483602e","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6a94f33dc874aa0cc2374bd2337fd3490a9f1cb762acbd95e72d5b946e7eb255","citations":["euclid-2-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since now CL is equal to the squares on AG, GB, and, in these, CE is equal to the square on AB, therefore the remainder FL is equal to twice the rectangle AG, GB. [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于现在CL等于AG,AG,GB,其中CE等于正方形,AB,因此其余FL等于矩形,AG,GB的两倍。 [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-102.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-102","revisionId":"euclid-10-102@raw-488398fed483602e","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9b3890bde772eddcb0b9e28ead5bde878cbe0eee4665c725a3ab27943ce6e056","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And twice the rectangle AG, GB is medial; therefore FL is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"矩形 AG,GB是中项无理线段的两倍, 因此FL也是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-102.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-102","revisionId":"euclid-10-102@raw-488398fed483602e","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1f820545a42d40758a6dd65d0cd7557f03e671b953538ce78e2393c7666b0efe","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line FE, producing FM as breadth; therefore FM is rational and incommensurable in length with CD. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其范围扩大到FM宽,因此,FM长为有理,不可公度长为CD。（相关点与线段：FE） [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-102.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-102","revisionId":"euclid-10-102@raw-488398fed483602e","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a6fc6e24467ace77f99f6cdea657d571acc2e87fd730aef4beb51ea63d7f1b98","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the squares on AG, GB are incommensurable with twice the rectangle AG, GB, and CL is equal to the squares on AG, GB, and FL equal to twice the rectangle AG, GB, therefore CL is incommensurable with FL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"还有自AG正方形起,GB不可公度,是矩形AG的两倍CL等于AG,GB时的正方形和FL等于矩形 AG,GB的两倍因此,CL是不可公度和FL。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-102.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-102","revisionId":"euclid-10-102@raw-488398fed483602e","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"964d1b2458a2c0f4ca46eadcc21fc6242057a3a4b3cc037e17d970c64b7c6b86","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as CL is to FL, so is CM to MF; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore CM is incommensurable in length with MF. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,CL比FL等于CM比MF,因此,CM比CL等于MF；CL 与 FL 之比等于 CM 与 MF 之比；上述对应量不可公度。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-102.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-102","revisionId":"euclid-10-102@raw-488398fed483602e","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"803c057b15b5c6caab07f1a524a68f768568fd6d8283e141700e01118796d37b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And both are rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两者都是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-102.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-102","revisionId":"euclid-10-102@raw-488398fed483602e","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0d5b6382448eb8af79f2d562bff4177093a0ada671d103d7727b7fa16adc308d","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore CM, MF are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore CF is an apotome. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,CM,MF是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;CF是截差无理线段。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-102.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-102","revisionId":"euclid-10-102@raw-488398fed483602e","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"89017e8e1c1fcd989d2330cc23e56f11b4f6c2b47be9ff24511f271459035b40","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also a sixth apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是第六个截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-102.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-102","revisionId":"euclid-10-102@raw-488398fed483602e","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"568a4c273491a5d9a9a3c6c326c27c59124579807b0121acf05247301cb2695d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since FL is equal to twice the rectangle AG, GB, let FM be bisected at N, and let NO be drawn through N parallel to CD; therefore each of the rectangles FO, NL is equal to the rectangle AG, GB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为FL等于矩形 AG,GB,FM分两切,N分,NO分,CD分,矩形 FO分,NL分,每分1 矩形 AG,GB分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-102.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-102","revisionId":"euclid-10-102@raw-488398fed483602e","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9b407cc21d3c7605e722fef9dea16ca9b566f9616fad2314f59825b27d4db639","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AG, GB are incommensurable in square, therefore the square on AG is incommensurable with the square on GB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AG,GB是正方形,正方形,AG,不可公度,不可公度,正方形,正方形,GB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-102.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-102","revisionId":"euclid-10-102@raw-488398fed483602e","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c6ce297b52b64779e2ef06c7ac5d90c7f80d9c6965d45f6916d27734139cd46b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CH is equal to the square on AG, and KL is equal to the square on GB; therefore CH is incommensurable with KL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CH等于AG,AG,KL等于正方形,GB;因此,CH等于不可公度,KL。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-102.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-102","revisionId":"euclid-10-102@raw-488398fed483602e","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e2b61f7548d1cf6fe26f05725bdc48cfb86539676360d3997500e6404166c66a","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as CH is to KL, so is CK to KM; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore CK is incommensurable with KM. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,CH对KL的比等于CK对KM的比;因此,CK对KM的比是不可公度对KM；CH 与 KL 之比等于 CK 与 KM 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-102.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-102","revisionId":"euclid-10-102@raw-488398fed483602e","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a04c6a1c5a6085208007eab7a9bf6707ac3978c7e774f576127bc3518f05857e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the rectangle AG, GB is a mean proportional between the squares on AG, GB, and CH is equal to the square on AG, KL equal to the square on GB, and NL equal to the rectangle AG, GB, therefore NL is also a mean proportional between CH, KL; therefore, as CH is to NL, so is NL to KL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为以 AG、GB 为边的矩形面积是 AG 的平方与 GB 的平方之间的比例中项，而 CH 等于 AG 的平方，KL 等于 GB 的平方，NL 等于以 AG、GB 为边的矩形面积，所以 NL 也是 CH 与 KL 之间的比例中项；因此，CH 与 NL 之比等于 NL 与 KL 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-102.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-102","revisionId":"euclid-10-102@raw-488398fed483602e","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fa01aa934dde066943cba5e02509dac47a877d9c50fa72166e31956c1267c7a7","citations":["euclid-10-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And for the same reason as before the square on CM is greater than the square on MF by the square on a straight line incommensurable with CM. [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"与CM正方形相比 MF正方形正方形正方形不可公度和CM直线正方形正方形3比正方形MFCM3级2级2级2级2级2级2级2级2级2级2级2级2级2级2级2级2级2级2级2级2级2级2级2级2级3级3级3级2级2级2级2级2级3级3级3级2级2级2级 [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-102.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-102","revisionId":"euclid-10-102@raw-488398fed483602e","order":19,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"97bf062a7730ca08edd8e59743975e01d2fb6bb6e71af2c21d7fe13ff0962315","citations":["euclid-10-def-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And neither of them is commensurable with the rational straight line CD set out; therefore CF is a sixth apotome. [[X. Deff. III. 6](/principles/euclid-10-def-16)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"这两部都不是可公度,有理线段 CD的设定,因此CF是第六部截差无理线段,Q,E,D。 [[X. Deff. III. 6](/principles/euclid-10-def-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-102.source","contentId":"euclid-10-102","revisionId":"euclid-10-102@raw-488398fed483602e","order":20,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8f2396ce7891d4d90fe0361abbb3ac36a45f7bb6eb05ea0e1c739499c981a3ab","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.102/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.102\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-102:euclid-10-78:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-102","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-102.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-78","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.102","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.102/","sourceLabel":"X. 78"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-102:euclid-10-22:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-102","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-102.proof.2","euclid-10-102.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-22","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.102","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.102/","sourceLab